* Generic Resistor Model
* Parameters: R=nominal value, DEV=device tolerance, TC1/TC2=temp coefficients

.MODEL RES_GENERIC RES(
  R=1
  DEV=0.05
  TC1=0.001
  TC2=0.000001
  TNOM=27
)

* Subcircuit wrapper with optional power rating enforcement
.SUBCKT RES_PWR 1 2 PARAMS: VALUE=10K POWER=0.25W
R1 1 2 {VALUE}
.ENDS RES_PWR
